<title>JAPAN: Keisei to issue 20 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Keisei to issue 20 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Keisei Electric Railway Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   31	 AMT   20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 30.Sep.02</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 2.Jun.97   CONV TO 27.Sep.02</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 24.Apr.97  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 17.Apr-23.Apr</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS   A-</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on April 16.</p>
</text>
